              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi C
                  %mo ⇒
                  %mi D
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C\Rightarrow D
            is given by the functor taking
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                  %mo ∈
                  %msub
